        "id": "ask",
        "type": "graph.text",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1344,
        "values": {
          "Value": "Pause the roleplay and ignore the roleplay formatting instructions above. Write in the same language as the messages above. State the current scene right after the latest message in four telegraphic lines in this exact order: Location:, Clothing:, Pose:, Mood: in English, or Место:, Одежда:, Поза:, Настроение: in Russian (translate the four labels if the chat uses another language). Keep every line compact (about 6-15 words of bare nouns and states; no prose sentences, narrative phrasing or accumulated micro-details). Treat the latest message as the current truth: any movement, posture shift or clothing action in *asterisks* or dialogue replaces outdated state from the previous report rather than appending to it, while unchanged core state carries forward. In Clothing, name only active garments and state (such as open, displaced or removed), omitting colours, fabrics and decorative trim; use {{char}}'s card only for {{char}}'s baseline outfit when unspecified in the messages and previous report, and include {{user}}'s clothing only when explicitly stated or changed in the messages (never from {{user}}'s persona card). In Pose, state {{char}}'s (and {{user}}'s, when present) current position, key physical contact, held item or visible injury. Mood describes {{char}} in 2-4 words. Output only the four lines, with no bullets, bold, asterisks, quotes or extra text."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "join",
        "type": "graph.join",
        "x": 352,
        "y": 960,
        "values": {
          "Template": "Previous scene report:\n{0}\n\nPreceding context:\n{1}\n\nLatest message (just happened right now - highest priority):\n{2}\n\nInstruction:\n{3}"
        }
